                                "example_id": "d3acb1de-068a-48a2-9c03-198d23c623a1",
                                "sense_id": "3f2d3bf0-9ef7-35be-b4f3-1aa6fae1d3e3",
                                "text": "A marble bénitier, vessel for holy water, is surrounded with what Alvarez has denominated a recurrent, or Cancrine verse, which forms the same words beginning at each end: ΝΙΨΟΝ ΑΝΟΜΗΜΑΤΑ ΜΗ ΜΟΝΑΝ ΟΨΙΝ."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
